        {
          "id": 834624538,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, I've also thought about this. Since I'm not sure whether I'll break other things with it, I've chosen the safe way for now.\n\nBut I will have a deeper look making the tvb functions more robust.",
